  title: "Hassas tart\u0131, boy ve i\xE7erik denetimleri ba\u015Flad\u0131"
  body: "COP31 Antalya denetim noktas\u0131nda kapsam geni\u015Fletildi. Meyve, sebze,
    et ve paketli g\u0131dalarda gramaj, asgari avlanma boyu ve ger\xE7ek meyve y\xFCzdesi
    kontrolleri devreye al\u0131nd\u0131."
  taskInstructionBox: "Tart\u0131 a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 (\xB15g),
